      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The displayed rewrites put the parity-dependent tau_chi term and the stated lambda_E expression into the shared sum coordinates S0, S1, and S3. This basis change makes previously developed sum estimates potentially reusable, but the short remark only announces that transfer and sends the actual inequalities to Appendix E; it does not itself establish a uniform theory or control any family-specific arithmetic remainder.",
